WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Example ideas only. What question will your original mission investigate?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.400
Include at least 5 obstacles. How will your terrain challenge the rover?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.600
One obstacle example: can you think of more than one safe approach?

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.800
Write your own program. Choose the sites, headings, times and actions.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.000
Test and improve. Explain the design choices you made independently.
